5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We need to ensure the operational feasibility of these plans. I'll be focusing on the staffing and crew side of things.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"I don't care about the paperwork. I want to know where the time is actually being wasted, not just who is complaining.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"A prudent approach, indeed. I suspect the devil is in the long-term financial commitments rather than the immediate totals.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Servas,,It is a joy to be here. Let us remember that the past is a mirror; we must look back to move forward wisely.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I agree. I am interested in the hidden approvals and the physical realities of the older structures.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
